Z||000000||Predator||12-13-2000||07:40 AM||||Well I finally got it all together except for the pipe that goes from the EGR valve to the manifold needing replacing the car is complete. I test drove it yesterday around the neighborhood, and all I have to say is I LIKE IT  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. The new exhaust gives the car a nice growl, and when I'm in second and give it a little juice to get the Turbo going, Boom it starts pulling great  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. I only used about 5 pounds of boost, but that was enough to get a feel for it. It reminds me of when I had my old big block. I haven't had a car that pulled that good in a long time. It was a lot of work to get the Turbo System installed, but if it holds up as good as it did yesterday it will be even more fun to drive than it was before.  ||||reg||10
